data: {"t":"d","text":"Here’s a visualization of a romantic beach wedding setup at sunset. The wooden arch, soft lighting, and tropical flowers create a serene and dreamy atmosphere. Let me know if you'd like to adjust or add anything!","toolActions":[{"tool":"generate_image","imagePrompt":"A romantic beach wedding setup during a breathtaking sunset, featuring a wooden wedding arch draped with flowing white fabric and adorned with lush tropical flowers in shades of coral, blush, and gold. The sandy aisle is lined with delicate lanterns emitting a soft, warm glow, leading gracefully to the arch. Wooden chairs with white cushions are arranged neatly on either side of the aisle, capturing an elegant yet intimate vibe. The serene backdrop includes softly crashing waves and a golden-orange sky with hints of pink and lavender, creating an ethereal atmosphere. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the arch slightly off-center for a modern editorial touch. Lighting is soft and golden-hour inspired, with lens flare adding a dreamy quality. Shot with an 85mm f/1.4 lens for a shallow depth of field, ensuring creamy bokeh while keeping the arch and aisle details crisp. The color palette emphasizes warm, tropical tones with muted sophistication while maintaining a contemporary and aspirational aesthetic.","imageAction":"generate","imageAspectRatio":"1536x1024","imageVariants":1}],"mode":"image","detectedLanguage":"en","responseLanguage":"en","audioUrl":null,"imageUrl":"data:image/png;base64,","imageUrls":["data:image/png;base64,"],"styleMemory":{"descriptors":["white, coral, blush, gold, orange, pink, lavender palette","romantic","elegant","modern","contemporary","tropical","sunset-lit"],"colorPalette":[],"aestheticRegister":"","culturalContext":"","lastGeneratedImageUrl":"data:image/png;base64,"},"products":[],"productsHasMore":false}

